###Cadastrar funcionario

POST http://localhost:3000/funcionario
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "nome1",
    "email": "email1",
    "senha": "senha1"
}


###Login de funcionario
# @name valToken
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "email1",
    "senha": "senha1"
}

###Cadastrar motorista
POST  http://localhost:3000/motorista
Authorization: {{valToken.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "vanderlei",
    "cnh": "1234",
    "cpf": "12345678912",
    "telefone": "12345678912"
}
